{"type":"message","id":"31a3858c","parentId":"1189e63d","timestamp":"2026-02-03T18:41:28.643Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_018ihFHUSzASQ2Lo91iyiNDq","toolName":"image","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Extracted Schedule Data from Architectural Drawing\n\nBased on my analysis of this architectural floor plan (A-101.00 - Cellar Floor North, Bellevue Hospital Center), I can extract the following information:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"drawing_info\": {\n    \"project_name\": \"BELLEVUE HOSPITAL CENTER\",\n    \"building\": \"BUILDING 'H'\",\n    \"project_description\": \"FIRE PUMP AND STANDPIPE REMOVAL PROJECT\",\n    \"address\": \"462 1ST AVE, NEW YORK, NY 10016\",\n    \"client_project_no\": \"26-2112-000\",\n    \"dob_no\": \"M00974604-11\",\n    \"sheet_number\": \"A-101.00\",\n    \"sheet_title\": \"MAIN BUILDING (H) CELLAR FLOOR NORTH PARTIAL REMOVALS PLAN\",\n    \"scale\": \"1/8\\\" = 1'-0\\\"\",\n    \"date\": \"05/16/2023\"\n  },\n  \"door_schedule_legend\": {\n    \"symbol_13\": {\n      \"description\": \"PROPOSED DOOR & FRAME (REFER TO DOOR TYPES & SCHEDULE)\"\n    },\n    \"symbol_AD\": {\n      \"description\": \"PROPOSED ACCESS DOOR & FRAME (REFER TO DOOR TYPES & SCHEDULE)\"\n    },\n    \"existing_door_frame\": {\n      \"description\": \"EXISTING DOOR & FRAME TO BE REMOVED\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"removals_key_scope_of_work\": {\n    \"D1\": \"REMOVE EXISTING DOOR AND FRAME\",\n    \"D2\": \"REMOVE EXISTING F.P. CONCRETE PAD, JOCKEY PUMP PAD\",\n    \"D4\": \"REMOVE EXISTING F.P. EQUIPMENT AND FIRE HOSE CABINET\",\n    \"D7\": \"SAW CUT OPENING IN EXISTING PARTITION TO PROVIDE ACCESS TO EXISTING F.P. RISER. PATCH WALL AT COMPLETION OF WORK TO MATCH EXISTING MATERIAL, THICKNESS AND COATINGS, AND PAINTED TO MATCH. NEW"}],"details":{"model":"anthropic/claude-opus-4-5","image":"/home/ec2-user/clawd/projects/blueprint/projects/Bellevue - Standpipe/vision-analysis/pages/arch-33.png","attempts":[]},"isError":false,"timestamp":1770144088637}}
